Just Type (com.palm.app.searchpreferences 1.0.0), the Settings app that chooses what Just
Type offers, as it is on the reference TouchPad (webOS CE 3.1.0), copied from its
/usr/palm/applications on 2026-11-03.

The app is here as it was packaged, and Lunacy does not change it (rule 5 in CLAUDE.md), but
for one image, as in Exhibition's settings app: images/appcatalog.png, the "Find More..."
button's HP shopping bag, is the webOS App Catalog's icon, the same file as the CE project's
system/usr/palm/applications/com.palm.app.searchpreferences/images/appcatalog.png
(webos-doctor-ce 67ad3d8) and as Exhibition's (codepoet, 2026-11-04).

Everything it shows and sets is com.palm.universalsearch's, which Lunacy answers
(card/UniversalSearch.kt); the shell's Just Type reads the same settings.

